    IC <P>

*Gmog wakes up… the images still in his head* 
He looks up quickly…… only to see a very old Troll woman sitting at the end of his room. She looks up, grins evilly and tosses a handful of bones on the floor. She studies the bones closely, takes a dagger from her belt, cuts her hand, and lets the drops of blood fall amongst the bones. 
<P>
“Ahhhhh Da bouns neber ly Warlurd…..” she cackles. “Seee Heer an Heer”, pointing as she speaks. “Yes, dis al sees it be da tim fer War.” 
<P>
Gmog slowly regains composure, it is beyond comprehension that this old troll could have gotten past all the guards in the hall. Yet here she was……. “Whu sent yu wich?” Gmog demanded. 
<P>
“Me weer sended by da masser Innyruuk M’Lurd……. He tuld me to giv yu da visuns yu juss had” 
<P>
The dream comes back to him…… A high elf paladin, standing before an army…… forces of light amassing to attack the lands of the dark races….. large speeches of a holy war….. and the slandered, the slandered Gmog knew to well…. It was the slandered of the Vanguard of Norrath….. Now it all made sense…. Now the pictures came together…. 
<P>
“Wich…. Me no now wat muss be dun”, shouting past her, “gard assemble me generals…. War is apon us.” 
<P><P>


OOC 
<P>
The Leadership of Vanguard of Norrath and Conclave meet last night. A date and ground rules have been agreed upon, and the war will be going forward. 
<P>
The war will last for 3 days….. dates are Thursday July 26th/ Friday the 27th/ and Saturday the 28th. 
<P>
I will post the Ground rules As soon as both sides have read them over and made sure there are no mistakes. Day or 2 max. 


